quot;color:#6B7280&quot;&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt; unique &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; A line joins a foreign key to the key it references: the forked end is the &lt;i&gt;many&lt;/i&gt; side, the bar the &lt;i&gt;one&lt;/i&gt; side, a circle means optional.&lt;br&gt;Links to &lt;b style=&quot;color:#1D4ED8&quot;&gt;users&lt;/b&gt; are drawn inside Accounts &amp;amp; System. Everywhere else, a link to &lt;b&gt;users&lt;/b&gt; or to another area is written on the column as &lt;b&gt;→ table&lt;/b&gt; in that area&#x27;s colour. Only &lt;b&gt;request_metrics&lt;/b&gt; has no relationship." style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;absoluteArcSize=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111827;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1769" width="2934" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e869" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=7;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=10;endSize=10;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r_password_resets__user_id" target="r_users__id"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="288" y="154.5"/><mxPoint x="288" y="139.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e870" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=7;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERzeroToOne;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=10;endSize=10;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r_email_change_requests__requested_by" target="r_users__id"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="304" y="327.5"/><mxPoint x="304" y="139.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e871" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html